{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 47,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 578.887,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.158,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now we will return in our record to Amalickiah",
      "verse": "47:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 3.338,
      "end": 7.193,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and those who had fled with him into the wilderness;",
      "verse": "47:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 7.373,
      "end": 10.67,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for, behold, he had taken those who went with him,",
      "verse": "47:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 10.85,
      "end": 14.24,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and went up in the land of Nephi among the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "47:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 14.42,
      "end": 18.971,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did stir up the Lamanites to anger against the people of Nephi,",
      "verse": "47:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 19.151,
      "end": 26.767,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that the king of the Lamanites sent a proclamation throughout all his land, among all his people,",
      "verse": "47:1",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 26.947,
      "end": 31.684,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they should gather themselves together again to go to battle against the Nephites.",
      "verse": "47:1",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 32.364,
      "end": 37.008,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when the proclamation had gone forth among them",
      "verse": "47:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 37.188,
      "end": 38.999,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they were exceedingly afraid;",
      "verse": "47:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 39.179,
      "end": 41.733,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, they feared to displease the king,",
      "verse": "47:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 41.913,
      "end": 45.628,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they also feared to go to battle against the Nephites",
      "verse": "47:2",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 45.808,
      "end": 47.851,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "lest they should lose their lives.",
      "verse": "47:2",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 48.031,
      "end": 50.678,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they would not,",
      "verse": "47:2",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 50.858,
      "end": 52.901,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or the more part of them would not,",
      "verse": "47:2",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 53.081,
      "end": 55.264,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "obey the commandments of the king.",
      "verse": "47:2",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 55.944,
      "end": 60.727,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that the king was wroth because of their disobedience;",
      "verse": "47:3",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 60.907,
      "end": 67.362,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore he gave Amalickiah the command of that part of his army which was obedient unto his commands,",
      "verse": "47:3",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 67.542,
      "end": 72.0,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and commanded him that he should go forth and compel them to arms.",
      "verse": "47:3",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 72.68,
      "end": 75.745,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now behold, this was the desire of Amalickiah;",
      "verse": "47:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 75.925,
      "end": 78.897,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he being a very subtle man to do evil",
      "verse": "47:4",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 79.077,
      "end": 83.86,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore he laid the plan in his heart to dethrone the king of the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "47:4",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 84.54,
      "end": 90.299,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now he had got the command of those parts of the Lamanites who were in favor of the king;",
      "verse": "47:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 90.479,
      "end": 94.473,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he sought to gain favor of those who were not obedient;",
      "verse": "47:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 94.653,
      "end": 98.136,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore he went forward to the place which was called Onidah,",
      "verse": "47:5",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 98.316,
      "end": 101.01,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for thither had all the Lamanites fled;",
      "verse": "47:5",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 101.19,
      "end": 103.651,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they discovered the army coming,",
      "verse": "47:5",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 103.831,
      "end": 106.757,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and, supposing that they were coming to destroy them,",
      "verse": "47:5",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 106.937,
      "end": 110.42,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they fled to Onidah, to the place of arms.",
      "verse": "47:5",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 111.1,
      "end": 118.623,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they had appointed a man to be a king and a leader over them, being fixed in their minds with a determined resolution",
      "verse": "47:6",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 118.803,
      "end": 122.286,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they would not be subjected to go against the Nephites.",
      "verse": "47:6",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 122.966,
      "end": 126.403,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they had gathered themselves together",
      "verse": "47:7",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 126.583,
      "end": 131.32,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "upon the top of the mount which was called Antipas, in preparation to battle.",
      "verse": "47:7",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 132.0,
      "end": 138.594,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now it was not Amalickiah's intention to give them battle according to the commandments of the king;",
      "verse": "47:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 138.774,
      "end": 143.65,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but behold, it was his intention to gain favor with the armies of the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "47:8",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 143.83,
      "end": 146.384,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might place himself at their head",
      "verse": "47:8",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 146.564,
      "end": 148.282,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and dethrone the king",
      "verse": "47:8",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 148.462,
      "end": 150.505,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and take possession of the kingdom.",
      "verse": "47:8",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 151.185,
      "end": 155.411,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, it came to pass that he caused his army to pitch their tents",
      "verse": "47:9",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 155.591,
      "end": 158.238,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in the valley which was near the mount Antipas.",
      "verse": "47:9",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 158.918,
      "end": 161.24,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when it was night",
      "verse": "47:10",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 161.42,
      "end": 167.968,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he sent a secret embassy into the mount Antipas, desiring that the leader of those who were upon the mount,",
      "verse": "47:10",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 168.148,
      "end": 169.866,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whose name was Lehonti,",
      "verse": "47:10",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 170.046,
      "end": 173.622,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he should come down to the foot of the mount,",
      "verse": "47:10",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 173.802,
      "end": 175.938,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he desired to speak with him.",
      "verse": "47:10",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 176.618,
      "end": 179.869,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when Lehonti received the message",
      "verse": "47:11",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 180.049,
      "end": 182.696,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he durst not go down to the foot of the mount.",
      "verse": "47:11",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 182.876,
      "end": 188.635,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Amalickiah sent again the second time, desiring him to come down.",
      "verse": "47:11",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 188.815,
      "end": 191.137,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Lehonti would not;",
      "verse": "47:11",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 191.317,
      "end": 193.732,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he sent again the third time.",
      "verse": "47:11",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 194.412,
      "end": 201.517,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when Amalickiah found that he could not get Lehonti to come down off from the mount,",
      "verse": "47:12",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 201.697,
      "end": 205.041,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he went up into the mount, nearly to Lehonti's camp;",
      "verse": "47:12",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 205.221,
      "end": 211.351,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he sent again the fourth time his message unto Lehonti, desiring that he would come down,",
      "verse": "47:12",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 211.531,
      "end": 214.039,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that he would bring his guards with him.",
      "verse": "47:12",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 214.719,
      "end": 219.409,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when Lehonti had come down with his guards to Amalickiah,",
      "verse": "47:13",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 219.589,
      "end": 223.676,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Amalickiah desired him to come down with his army in the night-time,",
      "verse": "47:13",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 223.856,
      "end": 226.364,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and surround those men in their camps",
      "verse": "47:13",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 226.544,
      "end": 229.052,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "over whom the king had given him command,",
      "verse": "47:13",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 229.232,
      "end": 232.808,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that he would deliver them up into Lehonti's hands,",
      "verse": "47:13",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 232.988,
      "end": 238.654,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if he would make him (Amalickiah) a second leader over the whole army.",
      "verse": "47:13",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 239.334,
      "end": 242.399,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Lehonti came down with his men",
      "verse": "47:14",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 242.579,
      "end": 244.947,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and surrounded the men of Amalickiah,",
      "verse": "47:14",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 245.127,
      "end": 247.913,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "so that before they awoke at the dawn of day",
      "verse": "47:14",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 248.093,
      "end": 250.787,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they were surrounded by the armies of Lehonti.",
      "verse": "47:14",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 251.467,
      "end": 257.179,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when they saw that they were surrounded, they pled with Amalickiah",
      "verse": "47:15",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 257.359,
      "end": 260.703,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he would suffer them to fall in with their brethren,",
      "verse": "47:15",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 260.883,
      "end": 262.787,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might not be destroyed.",
      "verse": "47:15",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 262.967,
      "end": 265.893,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now this was the very thing which Amalickiah desired.",
      "verse": "47:15",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 266.573,
      "end": 269.313,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he delivered his men,",
      "verse": "47:16",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 269.493,
      "end": 272.233,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "contrary to the commands of the king.",
      "verse": "47:16",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 272.413,
      "end": 275.014,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now this was the thing that Amalickiah desired,",
      "verse": "47:16",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 275.194,
      "end": 278.631,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might accomplish his designs in dethroning the king.",
      "verse": "47:16",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 279.311,
      "end": 282.051,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now it was the custom among the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "47:17",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 282.231,
      "end": 284.507,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if their chief leader was killed,",
      "verse": "47:17",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 284.687,
      "end": 288.124,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to appoint the second leader to be their chief leader.",
      "verse": "47:17",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 288.804,
      "end": 298.881,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Amalickiah caused that one of his servants should administer poison by degrees to Lehonti, that he died.",
      "verse": "47:18",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 299.561,
      "end": 301.511,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, when Lehonti was dead,",
      "verse": "47:19",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 301.691,
      "end": 303.967,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Lamanites appointed Amalickiah",
      "verse": "47:19",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 304.147,
      "end": 307.119,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to be their leader and their chief commander.",
      "verse": "47:19",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 307.799,
      "end": 311.282,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Amalickiah marched with his armies",
      "verse": "47:20",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 311.462,
      "end": 316.942,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "(for he had gained his desires) to the land of Nephi, to the city of Nephi,",
      "verse": "47:20",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 317.122,
      "end": 318.701,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was the chief city.",
      "verse": "47:20",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 319.381,
      "end": 322.539,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the king came out to meet him with his guards,",
      "verse": "47:21",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 322.719,
      "end": 326.341,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he supposed that Amalickiah had fulfilled his commands,",
      "verse": "47:21",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 326.521,
      "end": 333.626,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that Amalickiah had gathered together so great an army to go against the Nephites to battle.",
      "verse": "47:21",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 334.306,
      "end": 336.767,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, as the king came out to meet him",
      "verse": "47:22",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 336.947,
      "end": 341.359,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Amalickiah caused that his servants should go forth to meet the king.",
      "verse": "47:22",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 341.539,
      "end": 344.79,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they went and bowed themselves before the king,",
      "verse": "47:22",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 344.97,
      "end": 347.942,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as if to reverence him because of his greatness.",
      "verse": "47:22",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 348.622,
      "end": 352.523,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the king put forth his hand to raise them,",
      "verse": "47:23",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 352.703,
      "end": 357.068,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as was the custom with the Lamanites, as a token of peace,",
      "verse": "47:23",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 357.248,
      "end": 360.22,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which custom they had taken from the Nephites.",
      "verse": "47:23",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 360.9,
      "end": 365.033,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when he had raised the first from the ground,",
      "verse": "47:24",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 365.213,
      "end": 367.86,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold he stabbed the king to the heart;",
      "verse": "47:24",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 368.04,
      "end": 369.573,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he fell to the earth.",
      "verse": "47:24",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 370.253,
      "end": 372.436,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the servants of the king fled;",
      "verse": "47:25",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 372.616,
      "end": 376.378,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the servants of Amalickiah raised a cry, saying:",
      "verse": "47:25",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 377.058,
      "end": 380.82,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, the servants of the king have stabbed him to the heart,",
      "verse": "47:26",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 381.0,
      "end": 383.786,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he has fallen and they have fled;",
      "verse": "47:26",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 383.966,
      "end": 385.638,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, come and see.",
      "verse": "47:26",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 386.318,
      "end": 393.33,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Amalickiah commanded that his armies should march forth and see what had happened to the king;",
      "verse": "47:27",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 393.51,
      "end": 395.832,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and when they had come to the spot,",
      "verse": "47:27",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 396.012,
      "end": 398.241,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and found the king lying in his gore,",
      "verse": "47:27",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 398.421,
      "end": 401.115,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Amalickiah pretended to be wroth, and said:",
      "verse": "47:27",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 401.295,
      "end": 404.36,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Whosoever loved the king, let him go forth,",
      "verse": "47:27",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 404.54,
      "end": 406.212,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and pursue his servants",
      "verse": "47:27",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 406.392,
      "end": 407.925,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may be slain.",
      "verse": "47:27",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 408.605,
      "end": 411.67,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that all they who loved the king,",
      "verse": "47:28",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 411.85,
      "end": 413.754,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when they heard these words,",
      "verse": "47:28",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 413.934,
      "end": 417.045,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "came forth and pursued after the servants of the king.",
      "verse": "47:28",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 417.725,
      "end": 423.994,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now when the servants of the king saw an army pursuing after them, they were frightened again,",
      "verse": "47:29",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 424.174,
      "end": 426.217,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and fled into the wilderness,",
      "verse": "47:29",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 426.397,
      "end": 429.276,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and came over into the land of Zarahemla",
      "verse": "47:29",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 429.456,
      "end": 431.36,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and joined the people of Ammon.",
      "verse": "47:29",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 432.04,
      "end": 435.105,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the army which pursued after them returned,",
      "verse": "47:30",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 435.285,
      "end": 437.7,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having pursued after them in vain;",
      "verse": "47:30",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 437.88,
      "end": 442.199,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus Amalickiah, by his fraud, gained the hearts of the people.",
      "verse": "47:30",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 442.879,
      "end": 445.062,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass on the morrow",
      "verse": "47:31",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 445.242,
      "end": 448.028,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he entered the city Nephi with his armies,",
      "verse": "47:31",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 448.208,
      "end": 450.484,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and took possession of the city.",
      "verse": "47:31",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 451.164,
      "end": 453.44,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that the queen,",
      "verse": "47:32",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 453.62,
      "end": 456.128,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when she had heard that the king was slain\u2014",
      "verse": "47:32",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 456.308,
      "end": 459.884,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for Amalickiah had sent an embassy to the queen informing her",
      "verse": "47:32",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 460.064,
      "end": 462.897,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the king had been slain by his servants,",
      "verse": "47:32",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 463.077,
      "end": 465.817,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he had pursued them with his army,",
      "verse": "47:32",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 465.997,
      "end": 469.387,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but it was in vain, and they had made their escape\u2014",
      "verse": "47:32",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 470.067,
      "end": 475.129,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, when the queen had received this message she sent unto Amalickiah,",
      "verse": "47:33",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 475.309,
      "end": 478.56,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "desiring him that he would spare the people of the city;",
      "verse": "47:33",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 478.74,
      "end": 481.898,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and she also desired him that he should come in unto her;",
      "verse": "47:33",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 482.078,
      "end": 487.79,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and she also desired him that he should bring witnesses with him to testify concerning the death of the king.",
      "verse": "47:33",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 488.47,
      "end": 493.068,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Amalickiah took the same servant that slew the king,",
      "verse": "47:34",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 493.248,
      "end": 495.431,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all them who were with him,",
      "verse": "47:34",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 495.611,
      "end": 499.094,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and went in unto the queen, unto the place where she sat;",
      "verse": "47:34",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 499.274,
      "end": 504.615,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they all testified unto her that the king was slain by his own servants;",
      "verse": "47:34",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 504.795,
      "end": 506.42,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they said also:",
      "verse": "47:34",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 506.6,
      "end": 507.993,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "They have fled;",
      "verse": "47:34",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 508.173,
      "end": 510.402,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "does not this testify against them?",
      "verse": "47:34",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 510.582,
      "end": 515.04,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus they satisfied the queen concerning the death of the king.",
      "verse": "47:34",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 515.72,
      "end": 519.667,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Amalickiah sought the favor of the queen,",
      "verse": "47:35",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 519.847,
      "end": 522.03,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and took her unto him to wife;",
      "verse": "47:35",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 522.21,
      "end": 523.789,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus by his fraud,",
      "verse": "47:35",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 523.969,
      "end": 526.616,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and by the assistance of his cunning servants,",
      "verse": "47:35",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 526.796,
      "end": 528.468,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he obtained the kingdom;",
      "verse": "47:35",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 528.648,
      "end": 535.242,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, he was acknowledged king throughout all the land, among all the people of the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "47:35",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 535.422,
      "end": 545.964,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who were composed of the Lamanites and the Lemuelites and the Ishmaelites, and all the dissenters of the Nephites, from the reign of Nephi down to the present time.",
      "verse": "47:35",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 546.644,
      "end": 552.588,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now these dissenters, having the same instruction and the same information of the Nephites,",
      "verse": "47:36",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 552.768,
      "end": 556.158,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, having been instructed in the same knowledge of the Lord,",
      "verse": "47:36",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 556.338,
      "end": 558.846,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, it is strange to relate,",
      "verse": "47:36",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 559.026,
      "end": 564.181,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "not long after their dissensions they became more hardened and impenitent,",
      "verse": "47:36",
      "lineIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "start": 564.361,
      "end": 567.89,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and more wild, wicked and ferocious than the Lamanites\u2014",
      "verse": "47:36",
      "lineIndex": 151
    },
    {
      "start": 568.07,
      "end": 573.039,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "drinking in with the traditions of the Lamanites; giving way to indolence,",
      "verse": "47:36",
      "lineIndex": 152
    },
    {
      "start": 573.219,
      "end": 575.448,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all manner of lasciviousness;",
      "verse": "47:36",
      "lineIndex": 153
    },
    {
      "start": 575.628,
      "end": 578.229,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, entirely forgetting the Lord their God.",
      "verse": "47:36",
      "lineIndex": 154
    }
  ]
}